 *   parse_one  ~ O(1): switch on 1 byte + memcpy of 9–22 bytes
 *   parse_all  ~ O(N messages): no allocations
 *   Throughput ~ 10–30 ns per message (wire-rate at 40 Gbps Ethernet)
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------
 */
